{"id": "ingcrowd-japanese-themed-dialogue01", "kind": "audio", "suite": "passages", "category": "conversation", "media": "passages/ingcrowd-japanese-themed-dialogue01.wav", "reference": "うん。\nなんか車で何時間か行ったところにお茶どころが、あるんだけど\nはいはいはい。\nその\nお茶\nが\nすごい、美味しいっていうか何だろう独特な飲み方をする、ところがあって\nうんうん。\nなんか普通のお茶ぐびぐびって飲むんじゃなくて緑茶なんだけど何だろう\n雫をこう、ポタポタポタって、飲むみたいな\nえー。\n飲み方するところがあって、なんかそれは\n久しぶりにうち。私結婚してるんだけど\nうん。\n旦那さんと、私で二人で共通のこう、マイブームじゃないけど\nえー。\nヒットしてなんかそこはねなんか、定期的には行ってるかもしれない。", "language": "ja", "group": "ingcrowd-themed-dialogue", "source_url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/IngCrowd/japanese-themed-dialogue/blob/e2eed8769400269f20821deb0e47e68b40012e8b/japanese-themed-dialogue01/japanese-themed-dialogue01_audio.wav", "transcript_source_url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/IngCrowd/japanese-themed-dialogue/blob/e2eed8769400269f20821deb0e47e68b40012e8b/japanese-themed-dialogue01/japanese-themed-dialogue01.eaf", "license": "CC BY-NC 4.0", "credit": "IngCrowd Inc., Japanese Themed Casual Conversation Corpus", "theme": "Entertainment and hobbies", "start_seconds": 310.85, "end_seconds": 352.67, "duration_seconds": 41.82, "transcript_granularity": "publisher human verbatim, timestamped speaker turns", "annotation_ids": ["a196", "a102", "a197", "a103", "a104", "a105", "a106", "a198", "a107", "a108", "a199", "a109", "a110", "a200", "a111", "a201", "a112"], "transcript_policy": "Sort ELAN segments by start time, retain spoken fills and source punctuation, omit the laughter markup. Separate overlapping turns in start-time order.", "sha256": "91098d27a400281e71812fb48c128d17c8ffae40a5fe3b37405c65b41490a01f"}
